    "updated_at": "2017-02-01T17:16:02Z",
    "body": "no, same-origin domain ignores the port if the domains are set, while same origin does not.\r\n\r\nin the end, we don't have separate checks for same-origin domain, our code is here: https://cs.chromium.org/chromium/src/third_party/WebKit/Source/platform/weborigin/SecurityOrigin.cpp?rcl=f2b188baeb2938427bf58b6ff6b61840f325055b&l=243\r\n\r\nin the example table in the spec, this results in the check in row four for \"same origin\" to be an x for chrome instead.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
